WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.120
Speaker 1: Let's. Let's go next to. Let's go&nbsp;
to Paul Garcia from Mexico. Paul, welcome.&nbsp;

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:15.920
Speaker 3: All right. Can you hear me?
Speaker 1: Yes, I can.&nbsp;

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:19.440
Speaker 3: Oh, okay. We've&nbsp;
been you've been talking about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:28.080
how abortion and gang gun control can activate&nbsp;
Democrats vote. Do you think a Trump associate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:35.920
indictment can activate Republicans to vote?
